Pelican are creatures found in [[Terrain|Ocean Shallow Water]], [[Terrain| Ocean Deep Water]] or [[Seabird Rookery]]. They run at walking speed (2) on water and 3 on land, but flee at flying speed (horse speed 3). If you kill them, you can pick them up like a small animal that was trampled. [[Dead Pelican]] takes 2x2 slots in the inventory.


